      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I was hoping there would be a mode emulating how vrchat handles gestures for rift users, where your finger pose triggers a premade gesture. I like finger tracking but would also like the ability to disable it and have the index controllers perform like rift controllers do in vrchat.",
      "viewerReactions": null
