      "value": "@{5b6b4e8cb1b04a6db0be465d|full_name}: Agreed, and the tracking isn't always precise either. Assuming I eventually got used to which gesture triggers each action (which takes twice as long as memorizing trackpad positions), they just randomly trigger from natural hand positions or the finger tracking goofing up your finger positioning.\n\nHere's the simple solution: touchpad controls like the old days. The touchpad isn't even being used for anything right now. Keep the toggle gesture option though, it's genuinely a useful thing I wish the Vive controllers had (I moved it to the A button instead of clicking down on the stick).",
